Association Road Transport Minister Nitin Gadkari has affirmed that the vehicle organization TESLA will enter India in the coming year 2021. That is, Tesla&#8217;s electric vehicles will be sold in India from 2021. Yet, before that, let us inform you regarding the best 4 electric vehicles of Telsa. (tesla top electric vehicles) First of all, Tesla&#8217;s least expensive electric vehicle. Telsa&#8217;s least expensive vehicle so far is Model 3, which costs $ 35,000 for example Rs 22.45 lakh. The Tesla Model 3 is fitted with a standard battery with a scope of 3, 220 miles.

This vehicle can run at a speed of 225 km each hour. Discussing the length of the vehicle, it is 4,694 mm. It weighs 1,610 kg. Speed and gear framework, infotainment all have been planned independently in the vehicle.

&#8211; The subsequent vehicle is the Tesla Model X Long Range. It is one of the greatest reach electric vehicles on the planet. When this vehicle is completely energized, the electric SUV runs 325 miles for example 523 kilometers.

Its cost is $ 84,990 for example about 60.35 lakh rupees. &#8211; Third vehicle &#8211; Tesla Model S Long Range. This Tesla vehicle is additionally one of the greatest reach electric vehicles on the planet. When it is full charged, it runs for 370 miles for example around 595 kilometers. Its cost is $ 79,990 for example around 56.80 lakhs.

Tesla roadster is the fourth vehicle, the organization guarantees that the vehicle has a scope of 997 km. Also, its maximum velocity will be 407 km. Every one of these vehicles are furnished with innovative offices. Tell us that in the present time electric vehicles are being advanced more. There isn&#8217;t a lot of utilization of electric vehicles in the Indian market at present however electric bikes and bicycles are devoured. As indicated by a report, electric bikes are at present the most utilized electric vehicles in India.

